  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#link-type-preconnect\r\n\r\n> If options's crossorigin is *not* Anonymous and options's origin does not have the same origin as url's origin, then set useCredentials to false.\r\n\r\nThis seems to contradict the text in the applicable section of the [W3C resource hints](https://w3c.github.io/resource-hints/#preconnect) draft:\r\n\r\n> If corsAttributeState is Anonymous and origin is not equal to [current Document's origin](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#origin-2), set credentials to false.",
